{"id":"n45201-2-5","stage":4,"title":"까딱 · 一出差错","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n45201-2-5-1","ko":"비가 와서 길이 많이 미끄러워.","zh":"因为下雨，路变得很滑。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"길이","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"미끄러워.","meaning":"滑，滑润","explanation":"미끄럽다：滑，滑润；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"미끄럽다","audio":"/audio/bc9eb2fbf10eb7d4682e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15757","senseId":"1","lemma":"미끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미끄러워","audio":"/audio/413fea6c297887f79807.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"bc9eb2fbf10eb7d4","term":"미끄럽다","zh":"滑，滑润","audio":"/audio/bc9eb2fbf10eb7d4682e.mp3","entryId":"15757","definition":"指物体的表面滑溜，光滑到自动滑出去的程度。","pronunciation":["미끄럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/47b83f5a5968dbcd1486.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n45201-2-5-2","ko":"그러게. 까딱 실수를 하면 넘어지겠어.","zh":"是啊。稍有不慎就可能会摔倒呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"까딱","meaning":"一出差错，一不小心","explanation":"까딱：一出差错，一不小心。","readings":[{"term":"까딱","audio":"/audio/f300d93d2c7b5ddf6bde.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45201","senseId":"2","lemma":"까딱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"까딱","audio":"/audio/f300d93d2c7b5ddf6bde.mp3"}},{"text":"실수를","meaning":"失手，失误","explanation":"실수：失手，失误；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"실수","audio":"/audio/546e211475887e7443f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64947","senseId":"1","lemma":"실수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실수를","audio":"/audio/19e1517b3067726f9af8.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어지겠어.","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어지겠어","audio":"/audio/40255913558885451388.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"f300d93d2c7b5ddf","term":"까딱","zh":"一出差错，一不小心","audio":"/audio/f300d93d2c7b5ddf6bde.mp3","entryId":"45201","definition":"行动出现错误或做错事的样子。","pronunciation":["까딱"]},{"id":"546e211475887e74","term":"실수","zh":"失手，失误","audio":"/audio/546e211475887e7443f1.mp3","entryId":"64947","definition":"因不了解或不小心而犯的错误。","pronunciation":["실쑤"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3","entryId":"62363","definition":"站立着的人或物失去重心，倾向一边而倒下。","pronunciation":["너머지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/42bedc575302a90d105a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=45201","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊。稍有不慎就可能会摔倒呢。","您刚才没看到有个人从这里跑过吗？","因为下雨，路变得很滑。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊。稍有不慎就可能会摔倒呢。","因为下雨，路变得很滑。","您刚才没看到有个人从这里跑过吗？"],"answer":0}]}
